            For most people, the best oscillating tool is the cordless model from the battery platform they already own. If you are starting from scratch, the Milwaukee M18 FUEL 2836 is the fastest, best-balanced tool we would recommend, the Makita XMT04ZB has the best blade interface, and the Ryobi PBLMT50 offers the best value. For long, heavy jobs without batteries, the Bosch GOP55-36 is the most capable corded tool.
